{"cover":{"src":"audio/daniel/cover.m4a","text":"Daniel and the Lions.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":2.675,"words":[{"w":"Daniel","s":0.65,"e":1.05},{"w":"and","s":1.05,"e":1.163},{"w":"the","s":1.163,"e":1.25},{"w":"Lions","s":1.25,"e":2.075}]},"city-title":{"src":"audio/daniel/city-title.m4a","text":"Part One. Far from Home.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.125,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"One","s":0.85,"e":1.25},{"w":"Far","s":1.387,"e":1.675},{"w":"from","s":1.675,"e":1.825},{"w":"Home","s":1.825,"e":2.525}]},"city-0":{"src":"audio/daniel/city-0.m4a","text":"Long ago, Daniel lived far from home in the great city of Babylon. Daniel loved God, and he prayed to Him every single day.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.625,"words":[{"w":"Long","s":0.65,"e":0.95},{"w":"ago","s":0.95,"e":1.375},{"w":"Daniel","s":1.488,"e":1.925},{"w":"lived","s":1.925,"e":2.212},{"w":"far","s":2.212,"e":2.5},{"w":"from","s":2.5,"e":2.7},{"w":"home","s":2.7,"e":3.013},{"w":"in","s":3.013,"e":3.087},{"w":"the","s":3.087,"e":3.175},{"w":"great","s":3.175,"e":3.538},{"w":"city","s":3.538,"e":3.837},{"w":"of","s":3.837,"e":3.925},{"w":"Babylon","s":3.925,"e":4.925},{"w":"Daniel","s":5.125,"e":5.575},{"w":"loved","s":5.575,"e":5.888},{"w":"God","s":5.888,"e":6.6},{"w":"and","s":6.7,"e":6.812},{"w":"he","s":6.812,"e":6.925},{"w":"prayed","s":6.925,"e":7.2},{"w":"to","s":7.2,"e":7.325},{"w":"Him","s":7.325,"e":7.588},{"w":"every","s":7.588,"e":7.975},{"w":"single","s":7.975,"e":8.375},{"w":"day","s":8.375,"e":9.05}]},"city-1":{"src":"audio/daniel/city-1.m4a","text":"King Darius liked Daniel very much. Daniel was wise and honest and good, so the king made him one of the most important leaders in the whole land.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":10.675,"words":[{"w":"King","s":0.6,"e":0.825},{"w":"Darius","s":0.825,"e":1.337},{"w":"liked","s":1.337,"e":1.637},{"w":"Daniel","s":1.637,"e":2.1},{"w":"very","s":2.1,"e":2.4},{"w":"much","s":2.4,"e":3.2},{"w":"Daniel","s":3.4,"e":3.85},{"w":"was","s":3.85,"e":4.037},{"w":"wise","s":4.037,"e":4.612},{"w":"and","s":4.612,"e":4.8},{"w":"honest","s":4.8,"e":5.362},{"w":"and","s":5.362,"e":5.537},{"w":"good","s":5.537,"e":6.2},{"w":"so","s":6.338,"e":6.463},{"w":"the","s":6.463,"e":6.588},{"w":"king","s":6.588,"e":6.875},{"w":"made","s":6.875,"e":7.088},{"w":"him","s":7.088,"e":7.3},{"w":"one","s":7.3,"e":7.438},{"w":"of","s":7.438,"e":7.513},{"w":"the","s":7.513,"e":7.6},{"w":"most","s":7.6,"e":7.875},{"w":"important","s":7.875,"e":8.475},{"w":"leaders","s":8.475,"e":8.9},{"w":"in","s":8.9,"e":8.988},{"w":"the","s":8.988,"e":9.075},{"w":"whole","s":9.075,"e":9.325},{"w":"land","s":9.325,"e":10.1}]},"rule-title":{"src":"audio/daniel/rule-title.m4a","text":"Part Two. A Sneaky Plan.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.275,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.887},{"w":"Two","s":0.887,"e":1.275},{"w":"A","s":1.413,"e":1.538},{"w":"Sneaky","s":1.538,"e":1.925},{"w":"Plan","s":1.925,"e":2.675}]},"rule-0":{"src":"audio/daniel/rule-0.m4a","text":"But the other leaders were jealous. “Let’s get Daniel in trouble!” they whispered. They looked and looked, but Daniel never did anything wrong.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.425,"words":[{"w":"But","s":0.575,"e":0.688},{"w":"the","s":0.688,"e":0.8},{"w":"other","s":0.8,"e":1.075},{"w":"leaders","s":1.075,"e":1.475},{"w":"were","s":1.475,"e":1.637},{"w":"jealous","s":1.637,"e":2.55},{"w":"Let's","s":2.775,"e":3.025},{"w":"get","s":3.025,"e":3.225},{"w":"Daniel","s":3.225,"e":3.675},{"w":"in","s":3.675,"e":3.825},{"w":"trouble","s":3.825,"e":4.4},{"w":"they","s":4.525,"e":4.675},{"w":"whispered","s":4.675,"e":5.4},{"w":"They","s":5.537,"e":5.737},{"w":"looked","s":5.737,"e":6.05},{"w":"and","s":6.05,"e":6.2},{"w":"looked","s":6.2,"e":6.6},{"w":"but","s":6.675,"e":6.838},{"w":"Daniel","s":6.838,"e":7.287},{"w":"never","s":7.287,"e":7.575},{"w":"did","s":7.575,"e":7.725},{"w":"anything","s":7.725,"e":8.1},{"w":"wrong","s":8.1,"e":8.85}]},"rule-1":{"src":"audio/daniel/rule-1.m4a","text":"So they tricked the king. “O King, make a new rule! For thirty days, everyone must pray only to you. Anyone who prays to God will be thrown to the lions!”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":11.025,"words":[{"w":"So","s":0.6,"e":0.688},{"w":"they","s":0.688,"e":0.838},{"w":"tricked","s":0.838,"e":1.15},{"w":"the","s":1.15,"e":1.25},{"w":"king","s":1.25,"e":2},{"w":"O","s":2.25,"e":2.45},{"w":"King","s":2.45,"e":2.9},{"w":"make","s":2.975,"e":3.163},{"w":"a","s":3.163,"e":3.25},{"w":"new","s":3.25,"e":3.462},{"w":"rule","s":3.462,"e":4.125},{"w":"For","s":4.25,"e":4.438},{"w":"thirty","s":4.438,"e":4.775},{"w":"days","s":4.775,"e":5.225},{"w":"everyone","s":5.3,"e":5.775},{"w":"must","s":5.775,"e":6},{"w":"pray","s":6,"e":6.275},{"w":"only","s":6.275,"e":6.588},{"w":"to","s":6.588,"e":6.725},{"w":"you","s":6.725,"e":7.2},{"w":"Anyone","s":7.388,"e":7.775},{"w":"who","s":7.775,"e":7.925},{"w":"prays","s":7.925,"e":8.25},{"w":"to","s":8.25,"e":8.375},{"w":"God","s":8.375,"e":8.713},{"w":"will","s":8.713,"e":8.812},{"w":"be","s":8.812,"e":8.975},{"w":"thrown","s":8.975,"e":9.325},{"w":"to","s":9.325,"e":9.412},{"w":"the","s":9.412,"e":9.525},{"w":"lions","s":9.525,"e":10.425}]},"rule-2":{"src":"audio/daniel/rule-2.m4a","text":"The king liked the sound of that. He pressed his royal ring into the clay and signed the rule. And in Babylon, a king’s rule could never, ever be changed.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":11,"words":[{"w":"The","s":0.6,"e":0.713},{"w":"king","s":0.713,"e":1.05},{"w":"liked","s":1.05,"e":1.325},{"w":"the","s":1.325,"e":1.462},{"w":"sound","s":1.462,"e":1.762},{"w":"of","s":1.762,"e":1.85},{"w":"that","s":1.85,"e":2.55},{"w":"He","s":2.675,"e":2.8},{"w":"pressed","s":2.8,"e":3.087},{"w":"his","s":3.087,"e":3.263},{"w":"royal","s":3.263,"e":3.688},{"w":"ring","s":3.688,"e":3.95},{"w":"into","s":3.95,"e":4.138},{"w":"the","s":4.138,"e":4.225},{"w":"clay","s":4.225,"e":4.713},{"w":"and","s":4.713,"e":4.888},{"w":"signed","s":4.888,"e":5.213},{"w":"the","s":5.213,"e":5.312},{"w":"rule","s":5.312,"e":6.125},{"w":"And","s":6.25,"e":6.425},{"w":"in","s":6.425,"e":6.575},{"w":"Babylon","s":6.575,"e":7.4},{"w":"a","s":7.513,"e":7.638},{"w":"king's","s":7.638,"e":8.062},{"w":"rule","s":8.062,"e":8.4},{"w":"could","s":8.4,"e":8.6},{"w":"never","s":8.6,"e":9.05},{"w":"ever","s":9.15,"e":9.4},{"w":"be","s":9.4,"e":9.562},{"w":"changed","s":9.562,"e":10.425}]},"prays-title":{"src":"audio/daniel/prays-title.m4a","text":"Part Three. Daniel Prays Anyway.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.625,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.863},{"w":"Three","s":0.863,"e":1.325},{"w":"Daniel","s":1.45,"e":1.85},{"w":"Prays","s":1.85,"e":2.225},{"w":"Anyway","s":2.225,"e":3}]},"prays-0":{"src":"audio/daniel/prays-0.m4a","text":"Daniel heard about the new rule. But he went home, opened his window toward Jerusalem, and knelt down to pray, just like always.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.625,"words":[{"w":"Daniel","s":0.625,"e":1.05},{"w":"heard","s":1.05,"e":1.288},{"w":"about","s":1.288,"e":1.512},{"w":"the","s":1.512,"e":1.637},{"w":"new","s":1.637,"e":1.863},{"w":"rule","s":1.863,"e":2.65},{"w":"But","s":2.775,"e":2.913},{"w":"he","s":2.913,"e":3},{"w":"went","s":3,"e":3.212},{"w":"home","s":3.212,"e":3.9},{"w":"opened","s":4.037,"e":4.412},{"w":"his","s":4.412,"e":4.588},{"w":"window","s":4.588,"e":5.013},{"w":"toward","s":5.013,"e":5.35},{"w":"Jerusalem","s":5.35,"e":6.275},{"w":"and","s":6.388,"e":6.525},{"w":"knelt","s":6.525,"e":6.8},{"w":"down","s":6.8,"e":7.1},{"w":"to","s":7.1,"e":7.2},{"w":"pray","s":7.2,"e":7.625},{"w":"just","s":7.713,"e":7.963},{"w":"like","s":7.963,"e":8.15},{"w":"always","s":8.15,"e":9.05}]},"prays-1":{"src":"audio/daniel/prays-1.m4a","text":"Three times a day, Daniel thanked God and talked to Him. And the sneaky leaders were watching…","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":6.85,"words":[{"w":"Three","s":0.625,"e":0.825},{"w":"times","s":0.825,"e":1.163},{"w":"a","s":1.163,"e":1.225},{"w":"day","s":1.225,"e":1.675},{"w":"Daniel","s":1.8,"e":2.237},{"w":"thanked","s":2.237,"e":2.587},{"w":"God","s":2.587,"e":2.987},{"w":"and","s":2.987,"e":3.1},{"w":"talked","s":3.1,"e":3.4},{"w":"to","s":3.4,"e":3.5},{"w":"Him","s":3.5,"e":4.125},{"w":"And","s":4.25,"e":4.388},{"w":"the","s":4.388,"e":4.487},{"w":"sneaky","s":4.487,"e":4.9},{"w":"leaders","s":4.9,"e":5.263},{"w":"were","s":5.263,"e":5.4},{"w":"watching","s":5.4,"e":6.275}]},"den-title":{"src":"audio/daniel/den-title.m4a","text":"Part Four. Into the Lions’ Den.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.45,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"Four","s":0.85,"e":1.3},{"w":"Into","s":1.425,"e":1.637},{"w":"the","s":1.637,"e":1.725},{"w":"Lions'","s":1.725,"e":2.15},{"w":"Den","s":2.15,"e":2.85}]},"den-0":{"src":"audio/daniel/den-0.m4a","text":"The leaders ran to tell the king. King Darius was very upset, because he loved Daniel. But the rule could not be changed.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.95,"words":[{"w":"The","s":0.6,"e":0.7},{"w":"leaders","s":0.7,"e":1.113},{"w":"ran","s":1.113,"e":1.45},{"w":"to","s":1.45,"e":1.575},{"w":"tell","s":1.575,"e":1.812},{"w":"the","s":1.812,"e":1.9},{"w":"king","s":1.9,"e":2.6},{"w":"King","s":2.763,"e":3.025},{"w":"Darius","s":3.025,"e":3.5},{"w":"was","s":3.5,"e":3.688},{"w":"very","s":3.688,"e":4},{"w":"upset","s":4,"e":4.55},{"w":"because","s":4.6,"e":4.875},{"w":"he","s":4.875,"e":5.037},{"w":"loved","s":5.037,"e":5.4},{"w":"Daniel","s":5.4,"e":6.25},{"w":"But","s":6.35,"e":6.487},{"w":"the","s":6.487,"e":6.625},{"w":"rule","s":6.625,"e":7},{"w":"could","s":7,"e":7.175},{"w":"not","s":7.175,"e":7.388},{"w":"be","s":7.388,"e":7.537},{"w":"changed","s":7.537,"e":8.375}]},"den-1":{"src":"audio/daniel/den-1.m4a","text":"So Daniel was put into a deep den full of hungry lions, and a big stone was rolled over the top. “May your God save you, Daniel!” the king called.","voice"